{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國佛羅里達州周日（1日）造成機上9人全部罹難的私人噴射機空難，機上9名死者包括得州奧斯汀科技企業Retention.com共同創辦人兼行政總裁羅賓遜（Adam Robinson）、其妻子、兩名分別4歲及2歲的孩子、兩名家庭朋友、一名隨行保姆，以及55歲機長格雷戈里（Jeff Gregory）與20歲副機長菲爾蓋拉斯（Nathalia Filgueiras）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:58.741948+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:51:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:23.209271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.134161+00:00","content_hash":"bde93c65803f60340720080bbd9abcd413b17459e10de82ec1bb769383358e1e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}